==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6~21.33 seconds<sup>180f~640f</sup>.
*5 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 12~21.33 seconds<sup>360f~640f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Your primary focus should be meatshields and Cats with high DPS to handle the Gories and Relic Doges. You should bring [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fencer Cat]] to deal with the UltraBaaBaas, as its barrier breaking chance is at 100%. Use units like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], etc. Try to get a decent amount of [[Cats of the Cosmos]]'s [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] before attempting this stage. You may want to bring a [[Critical Hit|Critical Hitter]] for 2 and 3 Crown to not waste too much time on the Metal Hippoe, but it remains an unremarkable stage at all difficulties.

